  "body": "I have installed a Homeserver with spantaleevs ansible playbook. It works really fine.\r\nBut one problem I have, is when I try to search for contacts (f.e. when try to start a chat) - \r\nin Element-Web / Windows Client and in Element-IOs and Android App too.\r\n\r\nSome Users I can find without any problems, others just seems to be case sensitive\r\nan I can just find it if i write the correct uppercases. Some users I just can find\r\nif I enter a \"@\" in the searchfield, and then I have to find it in the list.\r\nDoes anybody have the same problem?\r\n\r\nThx in advance :-)",
